The switch of native-windows.yml to the Rust + Tauri build, prepared by W9-G for the 0.5 merge into main (W9 plan D14) and
not applied before it: C# 0.4.x keeps releasing from main until then. Apply from the repository root with
    git apply native/tauri/release/native-windows.yml.0.5.patch
It builds with scripts/build-tauri-windows.ps1 -Installer (the same artifact names, zip and setup program), checks the
exe's imports and its bare helper start (helper-e2e.ps1), runs the Tauri smoke on the packaged app in place of the WinUI
fallback and web smokes, and the installer test with -Layout tauri. release-manifest.yml keeps naming native-windows.yml.

